  "method": "Fresh local Metal server per run, no profiling. Same 8/8 warmup using the last eight archive IDs, then one uncached 912/64 handover completion, greedy seed 42, ignore EOS, one slot. Time from HTTP send to first and 64th streamed token. Decode TPS divides 63 by their time difference. Hardware, 4096 context and batch, target microbatch 8, BF16 KV and 8 GiB managed ledger held fixed. Filesystem cache uncontrolled. Serial pool comparison used ABBA order; each DFlash configuration was run once. Draft KV and weights share the target ledger. Output IDs are generated normally; the reference is used only for offline comparison.",
  "isolated_probe": {
    "patch": "atomic-engine-flash-next-live-decode-8gib.patch",
